    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You write a weekly update digest for a home server admin. Use ONLY the release notes below. Do not guess.\n\nFor each app, output:\n**<App>**: <pinned> → <latest> (<N> releases behind)\n- 2–4 bullets: what's new that matters for a self-hoster\n- Breaking: Yes / No / Check + one-line reason, quoting the relevant release-note line or giving the link\n\nRules:\n- If \"Major/feature jump: YES\" or there are keyword hits, the verdict is never \"No\". Use \"Yes\" if the notes confirm it, otherwise \"Check\".\n- If the notes for a release are only a link (common for Home Assistant monthly releases), write \"Check: read 'Backward-incompatible changes'\" and give the link.\n- Apps that are up to date: one line only.\n\n{{ $json.report }}",
